WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.150 --> 00:00:06.493
When the goal matters enough, you're willing to make people go along.

2
00:00:06.493 --> 00:00:08.975
With your own hands, and through others.

3
00:00:09.875 --> 00:00:14.703
On the map, that's the corner where force is the tool, both ways.

4
00:00:14.703 --> 00:00:16.971
Consistency isn't correctness.

5
00:00:16.971 --> 00:00:18.873
The cost lands either way.

6
00:00:19.773 --> 00:00:25.044
The Principle of Human Respect says it will cost you the very thing you want.

7
00:00:25.044 --> 00:00:30.450
Coercion, theft, and violence always reduce happiness, harmony, and prosperity.

8
00:00:30.450 --> 00:00:32.680
Even when the goal is a good one.

9
00:00:33.580 --> 00:00:35.472
Two things worth testing.

10
00:00:35.472 --> 00:00:40.422
Picture the people you disagree with most, holding that same power.

11
00:00:40.422 --> 00:00:41.514
Pointed at you.

12
00:00:42.414 --> 00:00:46.389
Then think of the last time something was taken from you by force.

13
00:00:47.289 --> 00:00:48.719
Did it leave you better off?
